# Link / Assemble of a STEP file (an extension), into an empty model
# saved beside it: a cylinder links as a
# reference mesh, a point at each vertex and circle centre, and its group
# screen says what was read. A file with no solid this reader supports
# links empty, its screen naming the entities it could not read.
file $testdata/step/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/step/shapes/cylinder.step
menu New Group|Link / Assemble...
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
file $testdata/step/corpus/ap203e2_csg.stp
menu New Group|Link / Assemble...
tw
